<title>BRAZIL: Bovespa resumes trade in Belgo Mineira.</title>
<headline>Bovespa resumes trade in Belgo Mineira.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sao Paulo Stock Exchange (Bovespa) said it resumed trade in Brazilian rolled steelmaker Belgo Mineira after the company said it was planning to buy a 26 percent voting stake in steel slabs producer Acominas.</p>
<p>Trade had been suspended Wednesday following a request from the firm which would make the announcement.</p>
<p>Belgo Mineira common stock was trading at 100 reais, while its preferred stock has not been traded so far.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
